				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-dcb4368 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="dcb4368" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-29fd833" data-id="29fd833" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3f461f9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="3f461f9" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">/ Opening hours </h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-8a32db3 elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="8a32db3" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Open daily from 9.30 am to 7.30 pm<br />(last ticket issued 60 min. before close)</p><p>Aperta anche 1 novembre, 8, 25 e 26 dicembre, 1 e 6 gennaio / Aperta anche Pasqua, Lunedì dell’Angelo, 25 aprile, 1 maggio, 2 giugno</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-83f3946 elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="83f3946" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p><strong>Late Night Openings</strong></p><p>La mostra sarà aperta fino alle 22.30: <br />sabato 24, venerdì 30 e sabato 31 gennaio, venerdì 6 e sabato 7 febbraio <br />(chiusura biglietteria ore 21.30)</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9ea08c1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="9ea08c1" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Open daily from 9.30 am to 7.30 pm<br />(last ticket issued 60 min. before close)</p>
<p>Also open 1 November, 8, 25 and 26 December, 1 and 6 January</p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-37002c9e elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="37002c9e" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-4b447678" data-id="4b447678" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-724f408e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="724f408e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" id="biglietti" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">/ Ticket office, reservation and advance booking</h2>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-72415d8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="72415d8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>During the exhibition period, <strong>ticket office is open daily from 9.30 am to 6.30 pm</strong> (last admission: 6.30 pm; exhibition closing time: 7.30 pm)</p><p>Tickets can be purchased at the ticket office on the day of the visit.</p><p><strong>To reduce waiting times, we recommend purchasing your ticket online in advance, as it allows you to access<br />the exhibition without stopping at the ticket office. </strong><strong>You will receive digital tickets via email, which you can print or show on your smartphone to the reception staff.</strong></p><p><strong>The online ticket booked in advance is valid for the selected date and time slot (for example, if you select<br />3.30 pm, entry will be permitted between 3.30 pm and 4.29 pm).</strong></p><p>Booking fee € 1.50</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-3c330246 elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="3c330246" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>Ticket office is open daily from 9.30 am to 6.30 pm</p><p><strong>I biglietti online sono esauriti. Puoi acquistare il tuo biglietto direttamente a Palazzo dei Diamanti </strong></p><p>A causa dell’alta affluenza, la coda potrà essere chiusa anticipatamente rispetto all’orario di chiusura della biglietteria.</p><p><strong>Per i giorni dal lunedì al venerdì è ancora possibile l’acquisto del biglietto online per ridurre il tempo di attesa e accedere alla mostra senza passare dalla biglietteria</strong>. Tramite l’acquisto online riceverai via email i biglietti digitali che potrai stampare o far visualizzare direttamente sul tuo smartphone </p><p>Booking fee € 1.50</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6f79b50 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="6f79b50" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>For any technical problem during online purchase please contact <a href="mailto:supportotmaster@vivaticket.it">supportotmaster@vivaticket.com</a></p>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-61f6bd7 elementor-hidden-desktop elementor-hidden-tablet elementor-hidden-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="61f6bd7" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section">
