				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>With the Alphonse Mucha entrance ticket you will be able to visit the <em>Giovanni Boldini</em> dossier exhibition: a significant selection of paintings, drawings and engravings dedicated to the theme of the portrait and the female figure.</p>								</div>
