				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-7c80f17 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="7c80f17" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<ul><li><strong>Palazzo dei Diamanti is accessible for persons with disabilities</strong><span style="font-weight: 400"><br /></span><span style="font-weight: 400">Accessible toilets are located in restroom; people with mobility restrictions can apply for a wheelchair, free of charge (advance reservation not available), at the Ticket office.</span><span style="font-weight: 400">Disabled parking places at Parcheggio Diamanti </span><a href="https://maps.google.com/?q=Via+Arianuova+21&amp;entry=gmail&amp;source=g"><span style="font-weight: 400">Via Arianuova 21</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400"> (cars access Via Arianuova; pedestrian access Via Rossetti and Via Spartaco)</span></li><li><span style="font-weight: 400">Please note that toilets are equipped with <strong>changing tables for babies </strong> </span></li><li><span style="font-weight: 400"> <strong> Strollers</strong> allowed</span></li><li><strong>Digital audioguide</strong>, free and available on smartphone</li><li><strong style="background-color: transparent;color: var( --e-global-color-text )">Lockers </strong><span style="background-color: transparent;color: var( --e-global-color-text )">are free of charge and available for mandatory check of bags and large items</span></li><li><span style="font-weight: 400">Free entry <a href="https://www.palazzodiamanti.it/en/bookshop/"><strong>Bookshop</strong></a></span></li><li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/caffedeidiamantiferrara" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Café</strong></a></li><li><a href="https://www.palazzodiamanti.it/en/carte-giovani-e-carta-del-docente/"><strong>Carte Giovani e Carta del Docente</strong></a> </li><li><span style="font-weight: 400">No food or beverages allowed inside gallery; animals, regardless of their weight and size, not allowed</span></li><li>Book Dog Sitting and Dog Walking service: <a href="https://www.bauadvisor.it/">Bauadvisor</a></li><li><a href="https://www.comune.fe.it/sposamiaferrara" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sposami a Ferrara</a></li></ul>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
